<body data-ui-theme="modern">
<main class="ui-page"><header class="stub-header"><div><img src="./docs/brand/icon.png" width="80" height="80" alt="web-ui icon"><h1 class="ui-title">web-ui</h1><p class="ui-muted">Shared static-first UI contract for myon-bioinformatics projects.</p></div><div class="stub-meta"><span class="ui-tag">v1</span><span class="ui-tag">build-free</span></div></header><section class="ui-grid"><article class="ui-card"><h2>Try it</h2><p>Switch theme and layout live: no reload, no stylesheet swap.</p><a href="#try">Open the switches →</a></article><article class="ui-card"><h2>MCP workspace</h2><p>Reusable MCP-style result/evidence/history structure, with a declarative mock.</p><a href="#mcp">Open MCP stub →</a></article><article class="ui-card"><h2>API workspace</h2><p>Same semantic workspace with consumer-owned API behavior.</p><a href="#api">Open API stub →</a></article><article class="ui-card"><h2>World (prototype)</h2><p>One page, a camera: scroll the shots, pan and zoom the map.</p><a href="#world">Open the world →</a></article><article class="ui-card"><h2>Random themes</h2><p>Seeded palettes side by side; every text pair meets WCAG AA.</p><a href="#wall">Open the wall →</a></article></section><section class="ui-panel" id="try"><h2>Try it</h2><p class="ui-muted">Both switches act at once: no reload. The theme is saved in this browser; the layout is plain CSS.</p><fieldset class="ui-layout-switch"><legend>Theme</legend><label><input type="radio" name="ui-theme" value="modern" checked> modern</label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-theme" value="github-like"> github-like</label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-theme" value="green"> green</label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-theme" value="red"> red</label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-theme" value="blue"> blue</label></fieldset><fieldset class="ui-layout-switch"><legend>Layout</legend><label><input type="radio" name="ui-layout" value="grid8" checked> 8px grid <small>ok at 320px, 384px, 768px, 1280px</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-layout" value="compact"> Compact <small>ok at 320px, 384px, 768px, 1280px</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-layout" value="device"> Device width <small>ok at 320px, 384px, 768px, 1280px</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="ui-layout" value="wide"> Wide <small>ok at 320px, 384px, 768px, 1280px</small></label></fieldset><ul class="ui-matrix-tiles"><li>tile 1</li><li>tile 2</li><li>tile 3</li><li>tile 4</li><li>tile 5</li><li>tile 6</li><li>tile 7</li><li>tile 8</li></ul></section><section><div class="stub-shell" id="mcp"><header class="stub-header"><div><h2 class="ui-title">MCP Stub Explorer</h2><p class="ui-muted">Protocol behavior stays with the consumer; web-ui supplies presentation and generic interaction.</p></div><div class="stub-meta"><span class="ui-tag">mcp</span><span class="ui-tag">ready</span></div></header><section class="ui-panel"><form class="stub-toolbar" id="mcp-form"><fieldset><legend>Stub request</legend><label for="mcp-query">Tool or filter</label><input class="ui-input" id="mcp-query" placeholder="tools/list"><button class="ui-button" id="mcp-run" type="submit">Run</button></fieldset></form><p class="stub-status ui-muted">Endpoint: <span class="stub-endpoint">consumer-owned</span></p></section><div class="stub-workspace"><section class="ui-panel stub-result"><h2>Result</h2><pre class="ui-output" id="mcp-output" aria-live="polite">Ready.</pre></section><aside aria-label="Supporting information"><section class="ui-card stub-evidence"><h2>Evidence</h2><p class="ui-muted">Trace, source, SHA, or request metadata can be rendered here by the consumer.</p></section><section class="ui-card stub-history"><h2>History</h2><p class="ui-muted">Consumer-owned history/export controls.</p><div class="stub-actions"><button class="ui-button" type="button">Export</button><button class="ui-button" type="button">Clear</button></div></section></aside></div><script type="application/json" id="mcp-mock">{"kind": "mcp", "query": "$input", "status": "stub"}</script></div></section><section><div class="stub-shell" id="api"><header class="stub-header"><div><h2 class="ui-title">API Stub Explorer</h2><p class="ui-muted">A generic request/result surface without API-specific logic in web-ui.</p></div><div class="stub-meta"><span class="ui-tag">api</span><span class="ui-tag">ready</span></div></header><section class="ui-panel"><form class="stub-toolbar" id="api-form"><fieldset><legend>Stub request</legend><label for="api-query">Path</label><input class="ui-input" id="api-query" value="/api/example"><button class="ui-button" id="api-run" type="submit">Send</button></fieldset></form><p class="stub-status ui-muted">Endpoint: <span class="stub-endpoint">consumer-owned</span></p></section><div class="stub-workspace"><section class="ui-panel stub-result"><h2>Result</h2><pre class="ui-output" id="api-output" aria-live="polite">Ready.</pre></section><aside aria-label="Supporting information"><section class="ui-card stub-evidence"><h2>Evidence</h2><p class="ui-muted">Status, headers, provenance, or timing metadata belongs here.</p></section><section class="ui-card stub-history"><h2>History</h2><p class="ui-muted">Consumer-owned request history and export actions.</p><div class="stub-actions"><button class="ui-button" type="button">Export</button><button class="ui-button" type="button">Clear</button></div></section></aside></div><script type="application/json" id="api-mock">{"method": "GET", "path": "$input", "status": 200, "body": {"stub": true}}</script></div></section><section class="ui-panel" id="curl" data-ui-curl><h2>Request draft (curl)</h2><p class="ui-muted">Paste a curl command: it is read in this page and never run or sent. Credentials show as <code>***</code>; the body is shown as written, so do not paste real secrets. Python reads it the same way (<code>web_ui.parse_curl</code>).</p><textarea class="ui-input" data-curl-input rows="4" aria-label="curl command">curl -X POST https://api.example.com/items -H "Authorization: Bearer abc" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"name":"demo"}'</textarea> <button class="ui-button" type="button" data-curl-run>Parse</button><pre class="ui-output" data-curl-output aria-live="polite"></pre></section><section class="ui-panel" id="world"><h2>World (prototype)</h2><p class="ui-muted">One page, a camera, no page changes. Scroll the shots; drag, wheel or pinch the map and open a spot. Python writes this HTML, the CSS and the small script from <code>EXAMPLES["world"]</code>.</p><section class="ui-world ui-world-shots" id="demo-shots" data-ui-world="shots" style="--shots:4" aria-label="web-ui world (prototype)"><div class="ui-shots-scroll"><div class="ui-shots-track"><div class="ui-shots-stage"><article class="ui-shot" data-i="0"><p class="ui-shot-hud">SHOT 01 / 04</p><h3>Arrive</h3><p>One page, no page changes. Scroll to move the camera through the shots.</p></article><article class="ui-shot" data-i="1"><p class="ui-shot-hud">SHOT 02 / 04</p><h3>Look around</h3><p>Each shot is data: a label, a title, a text and a color. Python writes the HTML and CSS.</p></article><article class="ui-shot" data-i="2"><p class="ui-shot-hud">SHOT 03 / 04</p><h3>Zoom in</h3><p>The only JavaScript marks what is on screen; CSS reacts to that mark.</p></article><article class="ui-shot" data-i="3"><p class="ui-shot-hud">SHOT 04 / 04</p><h3>Find it</h3><p>Scrolling reaches the information you came for.</p></article></div><div class="ui-shot-mark" data-i="0" style="--i:0"></div><div class="ui-shot-mark" data-i="1" style="--i:1"></div><div class="ui-shot-mark" data-i="2" style="--i:2"></div><div class="ui-shot-mark" data-i="3" style="--i:3"></div></div></div></section><section class="ui-world ui-world-map" id="demo-map" data-ui-world="map" data-zoom-max="4" aria-label="web-ui world (prototype)"><input class="ui-world-radio" type="radio" name="demo-floor" id="demo-floor-1f" value="1f" checked><input class="ui-world-radio" type="radio" name="demo-floor" id="demo-floor-2f" value="2f"><input class="ui-world-radio" type="radio" name="demo-cat" id="demo-cat-all" value="" checked><input class="ui-world-radio" type="radio" name="demo-cat" id="demo-cat-value-food" value="food"><input class="ui-world-radio" type="radio" name="demo-cat" id="demo-cat-value-info" value="info"><nav class="ui-world-bar"><label for="demo-floor-1f">1F</label><label for="demo-floor-2f">2F</label><label for="demo-cat-all" data-cat="">all</label><label for="demo-cat-value-food" data-cat="food">food</label><label for="demo-cat-value-info" data-cat="info">info</label></nav><div class="ui-board" aria-live="off" data-offset="" data-chars="155" data-offset-label><strong>INFO</strong><span class="ui-board-clock" data-clock>--:--</span><span class="ui-board-zones"><span class="ui-board-zone" data-zone-id="tokyo" data-rows="[1577836800,540]">Tokyo <b data-zone-clock>--:--</b></span><span class="ui-board-zone" data-zone-id="london" data-rows="[1577836800,0,1585443600,60,1603587600,0,1616893200,60,1635642000,0,1648342800,60,1667091600,0,1679792400,60,1698541200,0,1711846800,60,1729990800,0,1743296400,60,1761440400,0,1774746000,60,1792890000,0,1806195600,60,1824944400,0,1837645200,60,1856394000,0,1869094800,60,1887843600,0,1901149200,60,1919293200,0,1932598800,60,1950742800,0,1964048400,60,1982797200,0,1995498000,60,2014246800,0,2026947600,60,2045696400,0,2058397200,60,2077146000,0,2090451600,60,2108595600,0,2121901200,60,2140045200,0,2153350800,60,2172099600,0,2184800400,60,2203549200,0]">London <b data-zone-clock>--:--</b></span><span class="ui-board-zone" data-zone-id="ny" data-rows="[1577836800,-300,1583650800,-240,1604210400,-300,1615705200,-240,1636264800,-300,1647154800,-240,1667714400,-300,1678604400,-240,1699164000,-300,1710054000,-240,1730613600,-300,1741503600,-240,1762063200,-300,1772953200,-240,1793512800,-300,1805007600,-240,1825567200,-300,1836457200,-240,1857016800,-300,1867906800,-240,1888466400,-300,1899356400,-240,1919916000,-300,1930806000,-240,1951365600,-300,1962860400,-240,1983420000,-300,1994310000,-240,2014869600,-300,2025759600,-240,2046319200,-300,2057209200,-240,2077768800,-300,2088658800,-240,2109218400,-300,2120108400,-240,2140668000,-300,2152162800,-240,2172722400,-300,2183612400,-240,2204172000,-300]">New York <b data-zone-clock>--:--</b></span></span><div class="ui-board-track"><div class="ui-board-run" style="animation-duration:19.4s"><span class="ui-board-item">Gate: wait about 10 min</span><span class="ui-board-item">Show starts <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="10:30"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item">Guided walk <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="14:00"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item">Last entry <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="17:30"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item">London lunch <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="12:00" data-zone="london"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item">Open hours <span class="ui-board-gauge" data-from="09:00" data-to="18:00" data-cells="10" data-done="⌛" data-todo="⏳"><span class="ui-board-cells" aria-hidden="true">⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳</span> <span class="ui-board-pct">0%</span></span></span><span class="ui-board-item">Daylight <span class="ui-board-gauge" data-from="06:00" data-to="22:00" data-cells="8" data-done="🌕" data-todo="🌑"><span class="ui-board-cells" aria-hidden="true">🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑</span> <span class="ui-board-pct">0%</span></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Gate: wait about 10 min</span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Show starts <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="10:30"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Guided walk <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="14:00"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Last entry <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="17:30"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">London lunch <span class="ui-board-min" data-at="12:00" data-zone="london"></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Open hours <span class="ui-board-gauge" data-from="09:00" data-to="18:00" data-cells="10" data-done="⌛" data-todo="⏳"><span class="ui-board-cells" aria-hidden="true">⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳⏳</span> <span class="ui-board-pct">0%</span></span></span><span class="ui-board-item" aria-hidden="true">Daylight <span class="ui-board-gauge" data-from="06:00" data-to="22:00" data-cells="8" data-done="🌕" data-todo="🌑"><span class="ui-board-cells" aria-hidden="true">🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑🌑</span> <span class="ui-board-pct">0%</span></span></span></div></div><form class="ui-board-post"><input class="ui-input" name="message" maxlength="60" placeholder="Leave a line" aria-label="Leave a line on the board" autocomplete="off"><button class="ui-button" type="submit">Post</button></form><details class="ui-board-shared" data-api="https://api.github.com/repos/myon-bioinformatics/web-ui/issues/110/comments?per_page=100"><summary>共有掲示板（GitHub公開コメント）</summary><p>投稿はGitHubへのログインが必要です。本文・アカウント名・投稿時刻はインターネットに公開されます。個人情報や秘密の待ち合わせ情報は書かないでください。ページ内Postはこのページだけで、共有されません。</p><a href="https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/web-ui/issues/110#new_comment_field" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHubで公開投稿（別タブ）</a> <button type="button" data-shared-refresh>共有コメントを取得・更新</button><p role="status" data-shared-status>未取得。自動更新なし。更新間隔は最低120秒。</p><ul data-shared-comments></ul></details></div><div class="ui-world-view" tabindex="0"><div class="ui-world-cam" style="--fx:0;--fy:0;--z:1"><div class="ui-floor" data-floor="1f" data-w="960" data-h="640" style="width:960px;height:640px"><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-gate" data-x="120" data-y="320" data-category="info" style="left:120px;top:320px">Gate</a><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-hall" data-x="480" data-y="320" data-category="info" style="left:480px;top:320px">Hall</a><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-cafe" data-x="800" data-y="160" data-category="food" style="left:800px;top:160px">Cafe</a><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-shop" data-x="800" data-y="480" data-category="food" style="left:800px;top:480px">Shop</a><a class="ui-actor" id="demo-actor-farmer" href="#demo-spot-farmer" aria-label="Farmer"><span>🧑‍🌾</span></a><a class="ui-actor" id="demo-actor-cat" href="#demo-spot-cat" aria-label="Cat"><span>🐈</span></a><a class="ui-actor" id="demo-actor-duck" href="#demo-spot-duck" aria-label="Duck"><span>🦆</span></a><a class="ui-actor" id="demo-actor-robot" href="#demo-spot-robot" aria-label="Robot"><span>🤖</span></a><span class="ui-player" data-x="120" data-y="320" data-speed="96" style="--px:120;--py:320" role="img" aria-label="自分"><span>🧙</span></span></div><div class="ui-floor" data-floor="2f" data-w="960" data-h="640" style="width:960px;height:640px"><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-deck" data-x="240" data-y="160" data-category="info" style="left:240px;top:160px">Deck</a><a class="ui-spot" href="#demo-spot-lab" data-x="720" data-y="400" data-category="info" style="left:720px;top:400px">Lab</a><a class="ui-actor" id="demo-actor-owl" href="#demo-spot-owl" aria-label="Owl"><span>🦉</span></a></div></div></div><div class="ui-world-motion-controls" hidden><button type="button" class="ui-world-pause" aria-pressed="false">動きを停止</button><form class="ui-world-walk"><label>X <input name="x" type="number" min="0" step="any" required></label><label>Y <input name="y" type="number" min="0" step="any" required></label><button>ここへ歩く</button></form></div><aside class="ui-sheet" aria-live="polite"><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-gate"><h3>Gate</h3><p>Entrance and help desk.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-hall"><h3>Hall</h3><p>The central hall connects every area.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-cafe"><h3>Cafe</h3><p>Drinks and light meals.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-shop"><h3>Shop</h3><p>Snacks and souvenirs.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-farmer"><h3>Farmer</h3><p>Walks at a steady pace and stops to look around. Tap to ask.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-cat"><h3>Cat</h3><p>Wanders; no destination.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-duck"><h3>Duck</h3><p>Slow and sure.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-robot"><h3>Robot</h3><p>Moves in straight lines at constant speed.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-deck"><h3>Deck</h3><p>Open-air deck with a view of the hall.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-lab"><h3>Lab</h3><p>Hands-on corner for the curious.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article><article class="ui-sheet-item" id="demo-spot-owl"><h3>Owl</h3><p>Keeps the deck company.</p><a class="ui-sheet-close" href="#demo-map">Close</a></article></aside></section></section><section class="ui-panel" id="wall"><h2>Random themes, side by side</h2><p class="ui-muted">Twelve seeded palettes at once; every text pair meets WCAG AA by construction.</p><div class="ui-wall"><section class="ui-wall-cell" data-seed="0" style="--ui-bg:#f3eaf3;--ui-panel:#fbf7fa;--ui-fg:#663d63;--ui-muted:#7e637c;--ui-border:#d1bad0;--ui-accent:#5c6d0d;--ui-danger:#c72c23;--ui-radius:.25rem"><h3>seed 0</h3><p class="ui-muted">Muted text on the panel.</p><span class="ui-tag">tag</span> <button class="ui-button" type="button">Button</button> <a href="#" style="color:var(--ui-accent)">Accent</a> <span style="color:var(--ui-danger)">Danger</span><div class="ui-card">Card</div></section><