</style></head><body data-ui-theme="modern"><main class="ui-page"><section class="ui-panel ui-patterns" id="patterns" data-ui-patterns><h2>792 patterns</h2><p class="ui-muted">flutter_navigation_basic's catalogue, and the references behind its data-processing patterns.</p><label for="patterns-query">Search (id, title or theme)</label><input class="ui-input" id="patterns-query" data-patterns-query type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="filter, D003, ページング"><div class="ui-patterns-bar"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" data-patterns-count></span><button class="ui-button" type="button" data-patterns-more>Show more</button></div><div class="ui-patterns-bar"><label for="patterns-category">Category</label><select class="ui-input" id="patterns-category" data-patterns-category><option value="">All four</option><option value="navigation">A · ナビゲーション画面遷移</option><option value="api">B · API連携</option><option value="ui">C · UI/テーマ</option><option value="data">D · データ処理</option></select><label for="patterns-family">Reference</label><select class="ui-input" id="patterns-family" data-patterns-family><option value="">Any</option><option value="collection">collection</option><option value="concurrency">concurrency</option><option value="contract">contract</option><option value="convert">convert</option><option value="event_loop">event_loop</option><option value="future">future</option><option value="interaction">interaction</option><option value="native">native</option><option value="order">order</option><option value="page">page</option><option value="query">query</option><option value="reduce">reduce</option><option value="score">score</option><option value="screen">screen</option><option value="search">search</option><option value="select">select</option><option value="stream">stream</option><option value="structure">structure</option><option value="text">text</option><option value="transform">transform</option><option value="validate">validate</option><option value="window">window</option><option value="workflow">workflow</option></select></div><ol class="ui-patterns-list" data-patterns-list></ol><p><a href="/auth.html">Local authentication mock (loopback server)</a></p><h3 id="patterns-run-title">Run a reference</h3><label for="patterns-run-family">Family</label><select class="ui-input" id="patterns-run-family" data-patterns-run-family><option value="collection">collection</option><option value="concurrency">concurrency</option><option value="contract">contract</option><option value="convert">convert</option><option value="event_loop">event_loop</option><option value="future">future</option><option value="interaction">interaction</option><option value="native">native</option><option value="order">order</option><option value="page">page</option><option value="query" selected>query</option><option value="reduce">reduce</option><option value="score">score</option><option value="screen">screen</option><option value="search">search</option><option value="select">select</option><option value="stream">stream</option><option value="structure">structure</option><option value="text">text</option><option value="transform">transform</option><option value="validate">validate</option><option value="window">window</option><option value="workflow">workflow</option></select><label for="patterns-request">Request (JSON)</label><textarea class="ui-input" id="patterns-request" data-patterns-request spellcheck="false" rows="8"></textarea><div class="ui-patterns-bar"><button class="ui-button" type="button" data-patterns-run>Run</button> <button class="ui-button" type="button" data-patterns-example>Example</button></div><p class="ui-patterns-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-patterns-status></p><pre data-patterns-result></pre><p class="ui-muted">19 families run in this page. Contract, convert, search and validate stay in Python: the page shows what Python answers to their example (<code>python3 web_ui.py --pattern-serve</code> serves this page with a bridge that runs them).</p></section></main><script type="module">/* web-ui patterns: the pattern references of flutter_navigation_basic in the page (query, page, score's min-heap, reduce, workflow, transform, select, order, text, window, collection, structure) and the 792-pattern catalogue. Python (web_ui.pattern_*) is the reference; this must agree on every request, with the same refusal text. Three families (search, convert, validate) stay in Python: they lean on CPython's Unicode case folding, int parsing and urlsplit. JSON cannot tell 1 from 1.0 here: an integral number is an int, so a float written 1.0 reads as 1. */
